      "url": "https://github.com/dethdkn/ldap-studio/releases/tag/v1.1.0",
      "date": "2026-09-10T20:46:35Z",
      "notes": "<p>Moved the Rust core to pure C. Result: ~27% smaller than v1.0.0 despite new features, bundles its own OpenLDAP/OpenSSL/libxcrypt (nothing to install), and drops the Rust dependency tree and generated FFI.</p>\n<p>Thanks to <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/wagner-calazans/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/wagner-calazans\">@wagner-calazans</a> for the suggestions in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5405266094\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/dethdkn/ldap-studio/issues/1\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/dethdkn/ldap-studio/issues/1/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/dethdkn/ldap-studio/issues/1\">#1</a> and <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5405505971\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/dethdkn/ldap-studio/issues/2\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/dethdkn/ldap-studio/issues/2/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/dethdkn/ldap-studio/issues/2\">#2</a>.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/dethdkn/ldap-studio/commit/b6f09cac76647d9e09921331abbcf034af5eeeee\">♻️ Rewrite the core in C</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/dethdkn/ldap-studio/commit/b8341857c1762db81897947ba086ebba6a882f76\">🙈 Modify gitignore</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/dethdkn/ldap-studio/commit/83b53cbee6ee8ffb62f828857b75debf158b6c92\">💄 Improve directory tree icons</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/dethdkn/ldap-studio/commit/77a8f7494f73bb7f7778ad927897f47808f702e7\">✨ Show child count next to container names in the tree</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/dethdkn/ldap-studio/commit/51337209bee14eff554d8cae627871eb7e2c6044\">✨ Add group membership editor</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/dethdkn/ldap-studio/commit/e0f761022dc35ce3c168fd3c5698e77d3ed8ea24\">✨ Add guided New Entry mode</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/dethdkn/ldap-studio/commit/77ea7654236f7a5551f95014d471c1817866c83e\">✨ Add LDIF editor</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/dethdkn/ldap-studio/commit/0315abe0b0bc16ba23aa8ef7adc8cbc9adb01a51\">🎨 Add IDE-style syntax highlighting to the LDIF editor</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/dethdkn/ldap-studio/commit/740e1a7ada9ec057b90b8dec0ac08bba89cbe301\">✨ Add entry actions, shortcuts and scoped search to tree context menu (closes #1)</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/dethdkn/ldap-studio/commit/0c6e191f6e5be45d3afc97f4554d12308b126b52\">🔧 Disable macOS automatic window tabbing</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/dethdkn/ldap-studio/commit/e0f0c4551b20b35300ef79706148e777cda082c4\">🔒 Add StartTLS and per-connection certificate trust</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/dethdkn/ldap-studio/commit/33a34bbbad66d8190019af197745e93995d4e127\">✨ Add Go to DN quick-jump and per-connection bookmarks</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/dethdkn/ldap-studio/commit/2971bf08a6e9ea50100129d1c17ea61c89e7be44\">⭐ Add favorite connections</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/dethdkn/ldap-studio/commit/c677b6eeb79f70090931d9ec3d1a944e2689f23d\">🚸 Show affected entry count in recursive-delete confirmation</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/dethdkn/ldap-studio/commit/d52044804b97641214f6602c2bbf77d8f61d84f0\">✨ Add operational-attributes toggle to the entry detail view</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/dethdkn/ldap-studio/commit/c4476660adf70e9323abd948a0ac9bff0842d010\">✨ Add per-connection read-only mode and Duplicate action</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/dethdkn/ldap-studio/commit/6f2d14daa51b98f4d8d54692fdc27e1c1e5cbd10\">✨ Add LDAP operation log panel to the browser window</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/dethdkn/ldap-studio/commit/72e47197d7d204a0629c87d1be9e0e72c98d6c19\">✨ Add Edit Entry window (closes #2)</a><br>\